#ASSERT `Who owns the copyright now` `Jarrah's matching engine` `a contractor paid to write it` `a handshake assignment` EQUALS `the first owner`
#ASSERT `Who owns the copyright now` `Jarrah's matching engine` `a contractor paid to write it` `a signed assignment of the right to reproduce only` EQUALS `the assignee for what was assigned, the first owner for the rest`

