#ASSERT `What is the last year the copyright lasts` `the engine, its engineer dying in 2070` EQUALS JUST 2140
#ASSERT `What is the last year the copyright lasts` `a manuscript first made public in 2010, 20 years after its author died` EQUALS JUST 2080
#ASSERT `What is the last year the copyright lasts` `a program first made public in 2010, 20 years after its author died` EQUALS JUST 2060
#ASSERT `What is the last year the copyright lasts` `an anonymous program made in 2020 and released in 2025` EQUALS JUST 2095
#ASSERT `What is the last year the copyright lasts` `an anonymous program made in 2020, never released` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `What is the last year the copyright lasts` `an anonymous text made in 1960, never made public` EQUALS JUST 2030

